 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Item, Grade 2</em></p><p>A small handheld clay jar that acts as a vessel to trap a cursed spirit. As an action you can force a cursed spirit within 5 feet to make a DC 15 Charisma saving throw. On a failure, they are sealed within the jar.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>A cursed spirit with a CR lower than 1 automatically fails.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A cursed spirit with a CR higher than 2 automatically succeeds. The jar can hold a number of cursed spirits with a combined CR equal to 5. If the jar is destroyed, all contained cursed spirits are released.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>"
  },
